        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86046, Emtek Arts and Crafts Hammered Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hammered Cabinet Pull is a modern Tuscan design perfect for those who want something different when it comes to kitchen hardware. The Emtek Arts and Crafts Hammered Cabinet Pull is available in 3 center to center lengths: 3 inch, 3-1/2 inch, and 4 inch. Choose from satin brass, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel finishes for this arts and crafts collection cabinet hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/hammered-cabinet-knob-emtek-86037\"><b>Hammered Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Arts and Crafts Hammered Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86046</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86047</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86048</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-artsandcrafts-finish.jpg?v=1704354691\" width=\"345\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
